    "plain": "Banning single-use vapes removes millions of lithium-battery-containing devices from weekly litter and landfill, cutting waste fires and conserving critical materials \u2014 though early data show the ban is only partially effective so far, with millions of vapes still being discarded weekly.",
    "biggest_unknown": "Whether enforcement can suppress the illicit disposable market and whether consumers fully shift to properly-recycled reusable alternatives will determine the scale of the environmental gain.",
